# Groups 4 and 5 (timers, priorities, dispatch-order policies, 2026-11-10): timers_addition 13 of 14 and
# scheduler_policy_addition 6 of 6 pass on the board.
timers_addition/cancelled_timers_release_messages	target: arm_cancel_batch recurses 1000 deep without a tail call and every level keeps its message region in its frame, which outgrows the ~59 KB SRAM1 heap plus the 29 KB chunk arena ((:explicit, :out_of_memory) in armer); the timers do not leak: a 50 x 20 variant repeated 21 times (21,000 arm/cancel pairs) ended with the heap where it started (checked 2026-11-10)

